2026-10-28T10:33:23.3997147Z -- T6 — insight (#29 #52 #55 #65 #39 #40)
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3997236Z   ok   one noisy sample above the threshold books nothing
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3997321Z   ok   the second consecutive sample confirms the start
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3997414Z   ok   a falling edge needs two samples too, and books no start
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3997523Z   ok   the immersion element freezes the machine and resets the streak
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3997627Z   ok   after the element drops out a full clean edge counts again
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3997731Z   ok   the counter rides its store round trip, running state included
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3997823Z   ok   a pre-T6 store (or garbage) loads as an inert counter
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3997931Z   ok   the wear price: unpriced is 0, priced is cost over rated starts
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3998043Z   ok   a confirmed start books its wear price on the ledger's wear line
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3998125Z   ok   the default install books starts but no money
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3998216Z   ok   the autotune floors the cycling cost only when asked
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3998303Z   ok   the current action carries this step's reason codes
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3998420Z   ok   the reason lines partition the spot line, split by the plan's shares
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3998518Z   ok   the immersion carve-out comes out of the reason lines too
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3998619Z   ok   an interval without a tag books as untagged, not as nothing
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3998775Z   ok   an experiment's draw settles under the experiment's reason, never under the dead plan's
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3998919Z   ok   an experiment command under the running floor does not mark the pump on (D8-s1-01)
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3999003Z   ok   no receipt exists while the month is still open
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3999117Z   ok   the first settlement of a new month freezes the old month's receipt
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3999218Z   ok   the receipt's reason lines reconcile against its spot line
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3999333Z   ok   the receipt settles the CLOSED month's contracts, not the new month's
2026-10-28T10:33:23.3999425Z   ok   a frozen receipt never changes after its month closed
