2026-10-28T10:33:23.5146856Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5146940Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5147039Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5147107Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5147163Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5147216Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5147281Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5147347Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5148967Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149040Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149107Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149112Z 
