2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149238Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149311Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149371Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149452Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149514Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149586Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149656Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149733Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149833Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149927Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149931Z 
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5149990Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150078Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150154Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150295Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
