2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150370Z 
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150442Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150528Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150604Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150668Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150736Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150813Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5150931Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5151012Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5151087Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5151091Z 
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5151190Z -- A quiet Off window outranks a force-on pin (#1910)
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5151401Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5151504Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5151633Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5151637Z 
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5151768Z -- An Off window plans the anti-legionella cycle outside itself (#1910)
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5151896Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152007Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152226Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152340Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152432Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152437Z 
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152553Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152676Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152765Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152846Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152926Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5152930Z 
