2026-10-28T10:33:23.5153109Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5153175Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5153244Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5153350Z   ok   a non-string control and a switch control are domain verdicts
