2026-10-28T10:33:23.5153496Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5153569Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5153680Z   ok   a non-finite or over-nameplate power reading is no measurement
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5153766Z   ok   a power reading at the nameplate is a measurement
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5153862Z   ok   a frequency past its configured maximum measures nothing
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5153969Z   ok   no state callable and a non-positive nameplate measure nothing
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5154044Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5154114Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5154216Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5154348Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5154443Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5154547Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5154659Z   ok   a measured ceiling equal to nameplate does not install a cap array
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5154750Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5154859Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5154970Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5155071Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5155164Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5155289Z   ok   two empty specs parse as nothing; one empty spec does not drop the other
