2026-10-28T10:33:23.5155929Z   ok   absent quiet specs canonicalise to nothing, and a present one round-trips
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5156035Z   ok   a service call whose off window overlaps hot water is refused
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5156150Z   ok   an Off mask with no other cap still zeroes exactly its own space steps
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5156281Z   ok   the plan sensor publishes the not-enforced marker and the resolved actions
2026-10-28T10:33:23.5156399Z   ok   configured_specs returns the stored rows and the not-enforced marker
